CodeSystem: PathologyOrderableMyCore
Id: pathology-orderable-my-core
Title: "Malaysian Pathology Catalogue - Orderable Tests"
Description: "National orderable pathology test codes for Malaysia. Each concept is a test that may be ordered. Mappings to LOINC and to Malaysian interim codes are published as separate ConceptMaps."
